{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170382-examples-of-truly-vile-and-horrific-evil","id":1170382,"title":"Examples of truly vile and horrific evil?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-12-24T23:50:29-08:00","id":1170382,"title":"Examples of truly vile and horrific evil?","content":"Maybe I just don't have a solid understanding of the concept, but I can't stand Pentex as an antagonist; they seem to be the biggest reason WtA looks like &quot;Captain Planet on steroids.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pentex Exec</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;We're going to pollute your caerns and there's nothing you can do to stop us, since we're so powerful and you're so outnumbered! Mwuahaha, mine is an evil laugh, moustache-twirl!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>(Am I wrong? Tell me I'm wrong, please, lol)<br /> <br /> <br /> So most of the advice I've seen to get away from the &quot;planeteer&quot; vibe is to show just how truly awful servants of the Wyrm can be... But no one ever gives examples!<br /> I'm looking for examples. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Would anyone care to help me out?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12985-schwann145","name":"Schwann145","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T02:29:23-08:00","id":1170391,"title":"","content":"While obviously I could point out rape, torture, murder, etc. etc. that wyrm servants do, Pentex isn't supposed to be uniformly serious. A lot of it is heavily silly. &quot;Black comedy&quot; is how I would typically describe them.<br /> <br /> What does strike me as horrifying is the way that Pentex creates fomori, and makes the sick and often dying aberrations think that A) Pentex is here to help, B) they are now some kind of gifted mutant superhero and C) when they die, they are often ground up and given as drugs to new fomori. Obviously this can be silly as well. If the polluting factor strikes you as silly, you can simply omit it (there is enough Wyrmic corruption that doesn't involve pollution to last 101 sessions).<br /> <br /> Between Pentex, Tzimisce, and the Nephandi, I would say the former have an advantage in that they are sometimes played for serious horror and sometimes played for laughs, whereas the Tzimisce and Nephandi are almost never funny on purpose.<br /> <br /> One idea is to introduce a few NPCs that are somewhat sympathetic, and with a minor flaw, that grows into titanic proportions once they are transformed into fomori. You could go with a lifespan of 3 encounters for each of them, roughly: one with them as normal, one with them as corrupted as fomori but trying to hide it, and one as them as full on antagonists.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T02:32:55-08:00","id":1170393,"title":"","content":"<br /> Easiest method is simply to look at how real life businesses are doing things. While there might be one or two sociopaths among their ranks, it is their short sightedness that is the most evil part of them. Short-term profit means workers are worked to the bone, can't afford proper medical care, shops are understaffed to save costs and any woman who -dares- to have children either has to leave their kid to the care of relatives or get fired. This also means that the workers rarely if ever have energy to fight back, especially as union membership is a dirty word.<br /> <br /> Again, no malice other than simply being greedy. It is not that companies WANT to pollute the world, it is just cheaper and easier.<br /> <br /> If you want some examples of evil for other things than Pentex, here are three people I consider great examples of BSDs or just Wyrmy people;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/H._H._Holmes\" target=\"_blank\">H.Holmes</a> - He was a scammer and a liar, but that doesn't make him memorable. What -does- for me is that he also was an insidious murderer on top of it. He committed murder on an almost industrial scale for profit, selling skeletons of his victims for doctors to use. In a darkly amusing way, if he could get more by killing a person, he would.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Albert_Fish\" target=\"_blank\">Albert Fish</a> - If you ever want an example of how a BSD acts, in my mind, Albert is one. It isn't really what he did as to -how- he did it, he just did things out of curiosity and with a huge lack of care for social mores. No real rhyme or reason, he could be as cruel to himself as to others as well. Plus, he apparently never harmed his own children, adding to the strange way his mind worked.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richard_Ramirez\" target=\"_blank\">The Nightstalker</a> - Everyone makes their own choices, but I think this guy is a prime example of what happens when you are influenced by extremely toxic people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T02:49:36-08:00","id":1170395,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Deinos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170382-examples-of-truly-vile-and-horrific-evil?p=1170391#post1170391\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While obviously I could point out rape, torture, murder, etc. etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are these things that garou specifically care to intervene in, or just horrible things in general that monsters will do?<br /> <br /> I guess what I'm after is more, &quot;What makes WtA a game of horror and not a game of Socialist justice?&quot;<br /> But I appreciate the replies regardless. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12985-schwann145","name":"Schwann145","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T03:13:59-08:00","id":1170398,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Schwann145</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170382-examples-of-truly-vile-and-horrific-evil#post1170382\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe I just don't have a solid understanding of the concept, but I can't stand Pentex as an antagonist; they seem to be the biggest reason WtA looks like &quot;Captain Planet on steroids.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> (Am I wrong? Tell me I'm wrong, please, lol)<br /> <br /> <br /> So most of the advice I've seen to get away from the &quot;planeteer&quot; vibe is to show just how truly awful servants of the Wyrm can be... But no one ever gives examples!<br /> I'm looking for examples. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Would anyone care to help me out?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Uhhhh, does becoming a skinless, tentacle flailing zombie that regurgitates maggots into people's mouths count as an example?<br /> <br /> How about the Black Spiral's condoning of incest, rape, and even incest-rape?<br /> <br /> Speaking of Black Spiral Dancers, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1h91Fri8FO8\" target=\"_blank\">here's a video</a> talking about how they became what they are today.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 12-25-2017, 06:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T07:36:37-08:00","id":1170422,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Schwann145</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170382-examples-of-truly-vile-and-horrific-evil?p=1170395#post1170395\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><i> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Originally posted by <b>Deinos</b> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170382-examples-of-truly-vile-and-horrific-evil?p=1170391#post1170391\">View Post</a></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">While obviously I could point out rape, torture, murder, etc. etc.</span><br /> </span><br /> </i></span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Are these things that garou specifically care to intervene in, or just horrible things in general that monsters will do?</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>maybe not all Tribes, but yes they do. For example:<br /> <br /> Black Furies will fight to counter rape, abuse of women/children and sex-slavery (espscially in Eastern Europe);<br /> Bone Gnawers will fight against poverty, and by this fact, rape, murder, street drugs, etc.;<br /> Children of Gaia are big on Civil Right and Women Right wich touches these issues;<br /> Wendigo and Uktena are big in Native Right which also touches these issues.<br /> <br /> and that's just from the top of my head.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Project consolidation:<br /> Rough Draft: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1230422-rough-idea-for-a-werewolf-mini-supplement\" target=\"_blank\">Dhole Shifters</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1212511-city-book-seeking-advice\" target=\"_blank\">Ottawa By Night</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1194394-fanon-tribebook-bunyip-wip\" target=\"_blank\">Tribebook Bunyip</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/353881-your-new-revamped-tribes?p=354143#post354143\" target=\"_blank\">Garou Variant</a><br /> In redaction: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1151956-%E1%B9%A3ill%C4%81nu-b%C4%93lu-lasombra-bloodline-feedback-request\" target=\"_blank\">Lasombra Bloodline</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3226-boneguard","name":"Boneguard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3226_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T08:36:07-08:00","id":1170438,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Boneguard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170382-examples-of-truly-vile-and-horrific-evil?p=1170422#post1170422\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> maybe not all Tribes, but yes they do. For example:<br /> <br /> Black Furies will fight to counter rape, abuse of women/children and sex-slavery (espscially in Eastern Europe);<br /> <br /> and that's just from the top of my head.</div> </div> </div> </div>As long as those children aren't boys... otherwise, there's a chance of being killed at birth!<br /> <br /> The impression I get from the Black Furies is that they're a tribe of literal feminazi's who want to purge the male gender from the face of Gaia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 12-25-2017, 11:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T08:42:29-08:00","id":1170441,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170382-examples-of-truly-vile-and-horrific-evil?p=1170438#post1170438\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As long as those children aren't boys... otherwise, there's a chance of being killed at birth!</div> </div> </div> </div>If you're going by a dumb essay from the 1e player's guide that didn't even acknowledge the actual culture of Garou from the game, sure. Keep in mind that it starts off with a healthy heaping of violating the tenet of not eating humans, which at no point had they been presented as doing unless they were BSDs! I'm not talking &quot;oh, I frenzied and have a strange taste in my mouth, I better keep quiet,&quot; no. Full on intentionally killing someone to engage in anthropophagy. So maybe take it with an entire salt shaker, or even entire bag of salt.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T09:41:53-08:00","id":1170459,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170382-examples-of-truly-vile-and-horrific-evil?p=1170438#post1170438\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As long as those children aren't boys... otherwise, there's a chance of being killed at birth!<br /> <br /> The impression I get from the Black Furies is that they're a tribe of literal feminazi's who want to purge the male gender from the face of Gaia.</div> </div> </div> </div>some maybe, but in truth, the way I read it (especially more recent material), they are more of a &quot;Genuine&quot; feminist group who tries to bring a balance of power between both gender. In other word: gender equality.<br /> <br /> problem is, a ton of society/culture are heavily patriarchal, abusively so in some cases, and that leads a lot of Black Furies to go the &quot;easier&quot; route of feminazi and take a more antagonistic approach towards male in general.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Project consolidation:<br /> Rough Draft: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1230422-rough-idea-for-a-werewolf-mini-supplement\" target=\"_blank\">Dhole Shifters</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1212511-city-book-seeking-advice\" target=\"_blank\">Ottawa By Night</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1194394-fanon-tribebook-bunyip-wip\" target=\"_blank\">Tribebook Bunyip</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/353881-your-new-revamped-tribes?p=354143#post354143\" target=\"_blank\">Garou Variant</a><br /> In redaction: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1151956-%E1%B9%A3ill%C4%81nu-b%C4%93lu-lasombra-bloodline-feedback-request\" target=\"_blank\">Lasombra Bloodline</a>","edited":{"userid":3226,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3226-boneguard","user":"Boneguard","date":". 12-25-2017, 01:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3226-boneguard","name":"Boneguard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3226_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T19:13:30-08:00","id":1170572,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Boneguard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170382-examples-of-truly-vile-and-horrific-evil?p=1170459#post1170459\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> some maybe, but in truth, the way I read it (especially more recent material), they are more of a &quot;Genuine&quot; feminist group who tries to bring a balance of power between both gender. In other word: gender equality.<br /> <br /> problem is, a ton of society/culture are heavily patriarchal, abusively so in some cases, and that leads a lot of Black Furies to go the &quot;easier&quot; route of <b>feminazi</b> and take a more antagonistic approach towards male in general.</div> </div> </div> </div>Woah there, Rush. You might want to tone things down to people that actually exist, rather than the drug-induced fever-nightmares of conservative talk radio show hosts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T20:47:00-08:00","id":1170583,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170382-examples-of-truly-vile-and-horrific-evil?p=1170572#post1170572\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Woah there, Rush. You might want to tone things down to people that actually exist, rather than the drug-induced fever-nightmares of conservative talk radio show hosts.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry, are we talking about World of Darkness or the World According to Saur? Feminazis can totally exist, any ideology could be taken to an extreme.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T20:58:25-08:00","id":1170589,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170382-examples-of-truly-vile-and-horrific-evil?p=1170572#post1170572\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Woah there, Rush. You might want to tone things down to people that actually exist.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, I dislike the term, too. But there are certainly feminists that utilize an extreme level of thinking that I'd say is a bit &quot;unhealthy.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T21:36:00-08:00","id":1170597,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Schwann145</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170382-examples-of-truly-vile-and-horrific-evil?p=1170395#post1170395\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I guess what I'm after is more, &quot;What makes WtA a game of horror and not a game of Socialist justice?&quot;<br /> But I appreciate the replies regardless. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, an evil megacorporation is good for that. &quot;Evil corporations doing forbidden science projects and creating mutant killers&quot; are a pretty stock kind of antagonist. Alien series and Blade Runner for example touch on this sort of thing without having a socialist message (that I'm aware of).<br /> <br /> You can, in fact, run 101 WtA sessions without environmentalism coming up if you either don't like it or if you simply have a different niche.<br /> <br /> Black Furies don't want to kill all men. They are likely to distrust men, and cruelly despise intersexed metis, but they're not &quot;Red Talons, but vs men.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-26T00:13:56-08:00","id":1170617,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fat Larry</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170382-examples-of-truly-vile-and-horrific-evil?p=1170589#post1170589\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I mean, I dislike the term, too. But there are certainly feminists that utilize an extreme level of thinking that I'd say is a bit &quot;unhealthy.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Base on whose perspective, though?<br /> <br /> On the subject of werewolves, any opinion that a Garou with sufficient Rage holds is likely going to be something that people find to be &quot;frightening&quot; and &quot;unhealthy&quot; when most humans talk to said werewolf about it. There are probably far more distressing opinions for which a werewolf would gut you, such as, say, doubting the importance of bloodlines and lineages, which will probably get you into so much shit among any werewolf tribe that maintains the Pure Breed Background, with an order of magnitude or two more shit from any Silver Fang who happens to hear you express yourself. Like modern technology a lot and passionately admire how it makes life better? Also likely to be in for it from the same cluster of tribes. The Furies are kind of like Devil-Tigers who are less messy and self-indulgent on the course of picking up the devil, which kind of places even their extreme end in a better light than someone who's ready to turn you into a pile of meat for inadvertently insulting a long-dead king.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-26T00:33:32-08:00","id":1170619,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170382-examples-of-truly-vile-and-horrific-evil?p=1170617#post1170617\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Furies are kind of like Devil-Tigers who are less messy and self-indulgent on the course of picking up the devil, which kind of places even their extreme end in a better light than someone who's ready to turn you into a pile of meat for inadvertently insulting a long-dead king.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It was my understanding the Devil Tigers want to become literal demons so that they can kick the Yama Kings off their thrones and take over Hell?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Laughing Stranger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170382-examples-of-truly-vile-and-horrific-evil?p=1170583#post1170583\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sorry, are we talking about World of Darkness or the World According to Saur? Feminazis can totally exist, any ideology could be taken to an extreme.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I am almost positive they exist, both in setting, and in real life. There are quite an awful lot of angry feminists out there who come up with the absolute stupidest things to blame men for. Now add the rage of a werewolf into the mix and you can see how things snowball from there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 12-26-2017, 03:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-26T01:12:02-08:00","id":1170624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170382-examples-of-truly-vile-and-horrific-evil?p=1170619#post1170619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> It was my understanding the Devil Tigers want to become literal demons so that they can kick the Yama Kings off their thrones and take over Hell?</div> </div> </div> </div>First and foremost, to punish the wicked; they're supposed to be* comparatively functional successors to very dysfunctional and corrupt demon lords who gather power from corruption. Perhaps a comparison to the Nagah, only not super-secret, would have been better, but the duality of being a werewolf does play into it, since you're still being a monster that punishes wickedness and occasionally baits would-be wicked into acting on temptation and revealing themselves as such.<br /> <br /> *Supposed to be, often fall short.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-26T02:15:04-08:00","id":1170630,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170382-examples-of-truly-vile-and-horrific-evil?p=1170624#post1170624\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> First and foremost, to punish the wicked; they're supposed to be* comparatively functional successors to very dysfunctional and corrupt demon lords who gather power from corruption. Perhaps a comparison to the Nagah, only not super-secret, would have been better, but the duality of being a werewolf does play into it, since you're still being a monster that punishes wickedness and occasionally baits would-be wicked into acting on temptation and revealing themselves as such.<br /> <br /> *Supposed to be, often fall short.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah, I know the reason behind why they do what they do. But they're still on the journey to becoming the very enemy they fought so hard to destroy.<br /> <br /> If you want peace and equality, you send your diplomats, not your armies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 12-26-2017, 05:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-26T08:37:51-08:00","id":1170688,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170382-examples-of-truly-vile-and-horrific-evil?p=1170572#post1170572\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Woah there, Rush. You might want to tone things down to people that actually exist, rather than the drug-induced fever-nightmares of conservative talk radio show hosts.</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't worry, I was purposely going for a hyperbole (<a href=\"https://en.oxforddictionaries.com/definition/hyperbole\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.oxforddictionaries.com/definition/hyperbole</a>) to stre my point.<br /> <br /> unfortunately internet sometimes make it hard to convey intent","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Project consolidation:<br /> Rough Draft: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1230422-rough-idea-for-a-werewolf-mini-supplement\" target=\"_blank\">Dhole Shifters</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1212511-city-book-seeking-advice\" target=\"_blank\">Ottawa By Night</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1194394-fanon-tribebook-bunyip-wip\" target=\"_blank\">Tribebook Bunyip</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/353881-your-new-revamped-tribes?p=354143#post354143\" target=\"_blank\">Garou Variant</a><br /> In redaction: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1151956-%E1%B9%A3ill%C4%81nu-b%C4%93lu-lasombra-bloodline-feedback-request\" target=\"_blank\">Lasombra Bloodline</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3226-boneguard","name":"Boneguard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3226_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-26T09:45:20-08:00","id":1170710,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170382-examples-of-truly-vile-and-horrific-evil?p=1170630#post1170630\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Yeah, I know the reason behind why they do what they do. But they're still on the journey to becoming the very enemy they fought so hard to destroy.<br /> <br /> If you want peace and equality, you send your diplomats, not your armies.</div> </div> </div> </div>You may recall that W:tA is fond of comparing the duty of the Garou to being replacements for the Destroyer-turned-Corrupter. Ananasi similarly fill a replacement role for the Weaver Gone Mad, acting as they are through Ananasa. It so happens that being a Devil-Tiger involves not becoming the enemy they fight to destroy, but something that's learned a lesson from their long life and won't go down the same road that the original celestial functionaries of karmic punishment did, in much the same fashion. Any Devil of Heaven that actually does make it that far is likely going to stick to it, too, or else end up stripped of their power due to falling short and ejected from their position.<br /> <br /> Also, Garou are only an army in the loosest sense, as they are warriors rather than soldiers. A number of them are also diplomats of sorts, what with being given Gifts of insight and wisdom that outstrips human capability, as well as a talent for interacting and dealing with spirits. Above all else, however, they are also monsters, which allows them to continue trying where humans would have given up, but also makes them prone to, well, everything that happened in Werewolf.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-26T19:06:37-08:00","id":1170833,"title":"","content":"Book of the Wyrm 20 has some good stuff. But if you want an example from a game...<br /> <br /> Magadon owns a facility newly opened<br /> Supernaturally aware elements of Magadon local management entrapped a Gaia'n spirit of Family and Duty and bound it into the heart of the facility letting it sing its sing of power, forcing it to really, but the song is twisted by occult means<br /> They do a massive recruitment drive, offering good contracts for a 4 day week 9-5 that pays like its a 5 day week. Pretty good. Over time is capped at 4 hrs a week and barely pays at all. <br /> The Spiritual influence means the workers begin becoming work-a-holics. They don't even notice that they're clocking out at 8pm after starting at 8am and only when HR realises they're still there, very conscientious HR. <br /> They begin working an extra day here and there just to &quot;get ahead&quot; or &quot;go that extra mile to et noticed for the supervisors course with limited spaces&quot;.<br /> Friends and family concerns become bothersome, holidays are unwanted and any request for family time or r&amp;r is nagging. <br /> The divorces happen, abandonment or neglect happens, abuse happens and maybe a few people get killed, murder suicide combo. <br /> No one really notices, the only link is Magadon Pharmacuticals and even then it might operating with a different name. Besides all their due diligence, training and other legal documentation is in order (exempt maybe under Garou scrutiny). Plus they've recently made a dent into the local jobless problem. <br /> Magadon funds a local hospital/clinic, they also sell to themselves through the clinic. <br /> Magadon (or local execs) supports a local women's shelter and a domestic abuse and rape crises support group (with charity involvement). These have a deal with certain local medical care centres (guess which) which in turn also offer connection to psychological health care and support (who happen to be accredited under a Magadon sponsored Scholarship, or perhaps from another Pentex Sub sponsorship). <br /> The victims of abuse undergo treatment both psychologist sessions and medication (manufactured and sold by Magadon, provided part paid under Pentex Sub run health insurance for sure), but this treatment while it shows a 'public improvement' is actually imprinting something like Stockholme syndrome and sends the patients out looking for further abuse beginning perpetuating cycle. Of course all records show an imrivement in mental health so again to any investigators (save for Garou) their hands are clean on any incidents. <br /> In a couple of cases this becomes a twisted mania with recordings of the abusive acts made by abuser or abused (who gravitate towards a certain brand of recording/replay gear or software, probably SunBurst or Tellus affiliate) and that buzz breeds a Home Invasion Movies ring that targets home alone teens, records at assault and puts it out for sale.<br /> Three victims inevitably end up in the 'care' mentioned above. Or they go into a Teen therapy group for PTSD and other traumatic crises survivors,sponsored of course by some small corporate donations and in association with some local conservation initiatives. It's a wilderness set self esteem rebuilder thing. <br /> Accidents can happen at Wilderness Therapy sessions and any responsible conservation organisation that works with these projects and local rangers pretty much HAVE to put down the dangerous Man Eaters before any more accidents happen. <br /> There's a ton of money in bespoke fashion items of fur, teeth and claws. There's also a large 'natural alternative medicine' market for the wealthy but not wise to be exploited with (with very small printed disclaimers).<br /> <br /> And it can go on and on...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}